{"n":18,"title":"Stotras","blocks":[{"k":"img","src":"344","p":581,"hi":1},{"k":"p","x":"Stotra is a Sanskrit word, that means \"ode, eulogy or a hymn of praise\". A stotra can be a prayer, a description, or a conversation, but always with a poetic structure. It may be a simple poem expressing praise and personal devotion to a deity for example, or poems with embedded spiritual and philosophical doctrines. Many stotra hymns praise aspects of the divine, such as Devi, Siva, or Vishnu. Stotras should be chanted loudly. When the Stotra of Ishta Devta is chanted regularly everyday then it starts working like a Mantra. In this chapter powerful and rare.","p":581},{"k":"h2","x":"Stotras of various Gods & Goddesses","p":581},{"k":"img","src":"345","p":581,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"346","p":582,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"347","p":583,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"348","p":584,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"349","p":585,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"350","p":586,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"351","p":586,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"352","p":587,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"353","p":588,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"354","p":588,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"355","p":589,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"356","p":589,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"357","p":590,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"358","p":590,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"359","p":591,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"360","p":591,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"361","p":592,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"362","p":592,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"363","p":593,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"364","p":593,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"365","p":594,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"366","p":594,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"367","p":594,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"368","p":595,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"369","p":596,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"370","p":596,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"371","p":597,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"372","p":597,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"373","p":598,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"374","p":599,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"375","p":599,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"376","p":600,"hi":1},{"k":"img","src":"377","